  "queryImages": [],
  "deprecatedReference": false,
  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "54",
  "tip": "<p>When a question asks for <i>complete</i> audit visibility, think about turning on <i>Data Access</i> for all relevant resources and choose the lowest practical severity threshold, often <i>informational</i>. Remember that <i>Admin Activity</i> is on by default and does not replace Data Access.</p>",
